00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:20.960
The primary reason to do this is I unfortunately don't have the time to be consistent with

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:26.740
generating all the content and wanted to focus on creating consistent and regular episodes

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:30.720
for all the themes that I enjoy and I hope others do as well.
